      "before": {
        "devanagari_text_nodes_marked_hi": 0,
        "devanagari_text_nodes_not_marked": 15
      },
      "after": {
        "devanagari_text_nodes_marked_hi": 18,
        "devanagari_text_nodes_not_marked": 0
      },
      "note": "Devanagari runs in task, page-label, planner and card text are wrapped in lang=\"hi\" (WCAG 3.1.2). The panel scope is English and Hindi, so Devanagari is read as Hindi; Marathi or Nepali text would be mislabelled. Glyphs render through the font stack (Geist has no Devanagari; the sans stack names Noto Sans Devanagari, and this container fell back to FreeSans / FreeSerif). Rendering was checked by screenshot only, not by a Hindi reader."
    },
